'''[[Metal Face]]''' is fought during the Battle of {{XC1|Colony 9}}. This is his statblock for the first part of the fight, when he is first encountered in the {{XC1|Residential District}}. His HP cannot be depleted beneath 50%. This phase of the battle automatically ends when he uses his [[Extra data:Enemy Arts (XC1)/564|Last Resort]] [[Enemy Art (XC1)|Art]].

